OL,3,GNEWSABudget 2026: No more fat to trim
OL,4,Afor 'squeezed middle'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs Chancellor John Healey puts the
OL,7,Ffinal touches to his first Budget, how
OL,8,Fare the "squeezed middle" feeling after
OL,9,Fyears of cost-of-living pressure?
OL,11,FDawn Fazackerley-King is trying to work
OL,12,Fout how she and her family will pay
OL,13,Fhigher mortgage costs anticipated in a
OL,14,Ffew months' time.
OL,16,F"There's just no more fat to trim,"
OL,17,Fsays the mother-of-two.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
