OL,3,GNEWSABudget 2026: No more fat to trim
OL,4,Afor 'squeezed middle'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe interest rate on their Ipswich home
OL,7,Floan could rise from 1.4% to about
OL,8,F5.3%, which, Dawn says, could add
OL,9,F"about #250 extra a month just for
OL,10,Fliving in the same property".
